                  {
                    "value": "Every Cowork task is sorted into one of eight categories and valued with a low/mid/high human-effort band (minutes saved) from published research. Estimated Value applies the mid band, then loaded labor rate, reinvestment, and a conservatism penalty. Scheduled Share is tenant-wide (not a per-category split -- the real Purview audit log has no per-category scheduled/user-initiated field) and is sourced from the Microsoft admin center Cowork usage export; it is blank until that export is connected and populated, then updates automatically.",
